cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
title: >-
  DLBCL HMGB1-HAVCR2-MAFB multi-omics analysis pipeline
authors:
  - family-names: "Tang"
    given-names: "Jianwu"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-6619-5852"
version: v1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-13"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tjwu87/dlbcl-hmgb1-havcr2-mafb-analysis"
abstract: >-
  Multi-omics analysis code (scRNA-seq, LIANA cell communication, PAGA
  trajectory, pySCENIC regulons, CellOracle perturbation, spatial
  transcriptomics and bulk prognosis modelling) for the candidate
  HMGB1-HAVCR2-MAFB axis in the DLBCL tumour microenvironment.
keywords:
  - DLBCL
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - tumour microenvironment
  - pySCENIC
  - CellOracle
